@startuml seq-n8n-facture
title Diagramme de séquence -- Envoi automatique facture via n8n (Sprint 5)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor              #2C5282
    LifeLineBorderColor     #2C5282
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor  #2C5282
    ActorBackgroundColor    #FAFAFA
    ActorBorderColor        #2C5282
}

actor "Client" as Client
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "project-service" as PS
participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "SMTP\n(Gmail)" as SMTP

Client -> FE  : Accepter le devis
FE    -> PS   : PUT /api/quotes/{id}/accept
PS    -> PS   : Générer facture + résoudre clientEmail
PS    -> N8N  : POST /webhook/solarease-invoice
N8N   -> PS   : GET /api/internal/invoices/{id}/pdf
PS   --> N8N  : PDF facture
N8N   -> SMTP : E-mail + pièce jointe
SMTP --> Client : Facture reçue

note over PS, N8N
  Déclencheur alternatif~: projet COMPLETED
  (même flux, trigger project.completed)
end note

@enduml
